    66	## 1. Question 1 — Unit representation of binary cubics over polynomial rings
    67	
    68	**Question.** Let `I(S,T)` be a binary cubic over `R=C[x,y]` with squarefree discriminant. When is `I(s,t)=1` solvable in `s,t∈R`? Equivalently (Miranda / charged §1): when is the associated free cubic `R`-algebra globally monogenic?
