The key posture is now sharper: the announcement is an outline, while the later literature treats the \(N=4\) result as proved—and Zoladek supplies a separate degree-\(\le 5\) theorem. I’m finishing the citation checks and then I’ll write the report section by section, keeping the distinction between “accepted,” “independently proved,” and “hostilely audited.”
